  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate evocation; <strong>CL</strong> 8th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 12,500 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.<br>\n<strong>Recharge Cost</strong> 2</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis stout oak staff has been soaked for days in voidkissed water, granting the entire structure a weak connection to the void. At one end of the staff is an ornament in the shape of a burning star, which continually gives off a faint light. Such an etherstaff allows use of the following manifestations:</p>\n<p><em>farshaping</em> (1 charge)<br>\n<em>celestial sphere</em> (2 charges)</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Staff, celestial sphere, farshaping; <strong>Cost</strong> 6,250 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-items#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
